<title>CANADA: Inco Ltd files IPO to sell Doncasters unit.</title>
<headline>Inco Ltd files IPO to sell Doncasters unit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inco Ltd said on Monday that it plans to sell its engineered products business unit, Doncasters Plc, through an initial public offering.</p>
<p>Doncasters, formerly Inco Engineered Products, has filed a registration document in the United States for an underwritten public offering of eight million American Depositary Shares.</p>
<p>Each ADS represents two ordinary shares of Doncasters.</p>
<p>Through the offering, Inco will be selling 100 percent of its interest in Doncasters, Inco said in a statement.</p>
<p>Doncasters manufactures specialty metals and alloys mainly for the aerospace and industrial turbine industries.</p>
</text>
